1
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,840
Warning. Player violated the rules.

2
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:24,320
Bystander's Silence penalty
mechanism activated.

3
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:15,760
You pieced it together pretty fast.

4
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,600
Dr. Xiao.

5
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:20,050
Because someone stopped the car
from hitting us.

6
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:41,400
The highest place. If I get a perfect
score, I can go to the highest place.

7
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,160
Let's go.

8
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:16,880
The door is locked from the outside.

9
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,260
What's wrong with him?

10
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,200
Should we look for medicine?

11
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:25,160
There's no medicine. There's nothing.

12
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,380
It's not a disease.

13
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:30,290
It's hyperventilation caused
by an acute panic attack.

14
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:33,520
His psychological trauma of being
locked up and abandoned

15
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:36,720
has manifested here as claustrophobia
and suffocation.

16
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,780
Looking for medicine is useless.

17
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,840
If we can't find the lethal evidence
that triggered his trauma,

18
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,840
he will suffocate himself to death.

19
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,600
On the 14th, signed the divorce agreement.

20
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,900
On the 15th, wrote the letter
of commitment.

21
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:52,800
The closet is empty.

22
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:56,480
The drag marks of the suitcase
are very clear on the floor.

23
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,440
This is not a reward at all.

24
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:01,760
They completely moved out
and abandoned him that day.

25
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,600
There's no need for him to see this.

26
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,320
Warning. Key clues are being destroyed.

27
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,600
There's only a pile of garbage
in this room.

28
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,440
No clues.

29
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:21,050
This guy is getting more
and more empathetic.

30
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,800
Dear visitors,

31
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:38,160
there are only five minutes left
until the park closes.

32
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:41,000
Parents, please lead your children out
of the park as soon as possible.

33
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:41,800
After closing,

34
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:45,840
all children who haven't been picked up
will stay in the park forever.

35
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,440
No, I don't want to stay here.

36
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,360
I don't want to stay here.

37
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,560
Pang.

38
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,040
Mom, Dad.

39
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:53,960
I'm here.

40
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,400
Come pick me up.

41
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:03,560
Why did I get a perfect score,

42
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,040
I pieced the test paper together,

43
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,360
and got every question right,

44
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,560
but you still won't take me?

45
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,240
You need to be sensible.

46
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,200
Mom and Dad are very busy.

47
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,280
Don't keep pestering us.

48
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,620
We'll talk about it next time you do well.

49
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,760
If you keep banging, you'll really die.

50
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,760
Look back.

51
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,720
Look at us.

52
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,400
You don't understand.

53
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,200
They promised to pick me up at 5:30.

54
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,320
I've always been obedient.

55
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,320
I endured everything.

56
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,360
I didn't make a fuss
or spend money recklessly.

57
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,520
I didn't cause them any trouble.

58
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,760
I did it all.

59
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,720
So what am I still lacking?

60
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,560
It was never your fault.

61
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,490
They never intended to pick you up.

62
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:40,560
No.

63
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,960
This is not fair.

64
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:54,480
Even if the clocks here weren't
stuck at 5:30 forever,

65
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,610
they wouldn't come.

66
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,840
It's because I'm not good enough.

67
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,640
It's not that you're not good enough.

68
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,720
It's that they don't deserve
to be parents.

69
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,640
This is a scam destined

70
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,240
to have no one waiting for you.

71
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:06,360
You are torturing yourself
with other people's mistakes.

72
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,520
Now,

73
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,880
cut off the rotten flesh.

74
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:09,880
Stop waiting.

75
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,820
Did you hear what Han said?

76
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,220
Stop waiting for them.

77
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,360
There are still five of us
on this broken car.

78
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,960
Let's go. We'll take you out of the park.

79
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,720
Yes, we'll take you out.

80
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,040
We'll leave the park together.

81
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,960
Congratulations, tourists.

82
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:52,159
You've perfectly cleared the third stop,
Childhood Dream Amusement Park.

83
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,000
Five went in,

84
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,880
five came out.

85
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,880
We did it.

86
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,120
Nether Mortuary,

87
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,720
Huang Kai's obsession with his late wife.

88
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:09,000
Ghost Empress's Palace, Chen Qiang's
obsession with power and control.

89
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,530
Innocence Amusement Park,

90
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:13,170
Pang's obsession with
a complete childhood.

91
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,840
Every stop

92
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:18,500
is manifested from
the inner demons of one of us.

93
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:21,520
So whose turn will it be next?

94
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,840
I have no obsessions.

95
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,920
What about you, Xiao Han?

96
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,360
What is

97
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,240
your obsession?

98
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,680
Take a guess.

99
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:50,560
One wrong step across the boundary
of life and death,

100
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:53,640
how can I bear my misplaced kindness?

101
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,560
Pity the broken soul,

102
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,080
blood staining the long street,

103
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:58,409
with nowhere to cry out.

104
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:01,480
Beating the loud drum to claim a life.
